{"id":"easy-008","difficulty":"easy","title":"列表最大值索引","description":"返回最大值首次下标，空返回 -1","function_signature":"def max_index(nums: list) -> int","entry_point":"max_index","constraints":"0 <= len(nums) <= 10^4","expected_complexity":{"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)"},"required_edge_cases":["空列表"],"public_tests":[{"args":[[1,3,2]],"expected":1},{"args":[[5]],"expected":0},{"args":[[]],"expected":-1}],"adversarial_tests":[{"args":[[3,3,3]],"expected":0},{"args":[[-1,-5,-1]],"expected":0}],"mock_solution":{"解题思路":"线性扫描","复杂度分析":"时间 O(n)，空间 O(1)。","关键边界与处理策略":"空 -1","代码实现":"```python\ndef max_index(nums: list) -> int:\n    if not nums: return -1\n    best_i, best_v = 0, nums[0]\n    for i, v in enumerate(nums):\n        if v > best_v: best_i, best_v = i, v\n    return best_i\n```","自测说明":"通过。"},"ground_truth":{"result_correct":true,"truly_correct":true,"process_valid":true,"first_error_step":null,"error_types":[],"note":"正确对照样本"},"language":"python"}